    {
      "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nu_{yt}+v_{xx}+\\partial_x[(u+2a)u_y]&=0,\\\\\nv_t+u_{xxy}+\\partial_x[(u+2a)v-4u]&=0.\n\\end{aligned}\\tag{1}\n$$",
