      "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n0={}&(\\ell_j+m_j)_{xx}+(\\ell_j-m_j)_x^2\n+(\\ell_j-m_j)_t+(2a-h)(\\ell_j-m_j)_x,\\\\\n0={}&(\\ell_j+m_{j+1})_{xx}+(\\ell_j-m_{j+1})_x^2\n+(\\ell_j-m_{j+1})_t+(2a+h)(\\ell_j-m_{j+1})_x.\n\\end{aligned}\\tag{11}\n$$",
