    {
      "text": "$$\nu_j=(2\\ell_j-m_j-m_{j+1})_x,\\qquad\n\\omega_j=(m_{j+1}-m_j)_x,\\qquad\nZ_j=(2\\ell_j+m_j+m_{j+1})_x.\\tag{12}\n$$",
