      "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nu_{j,t}+\\partial_x\\!\\left[A(u_j)+\\frac{\\omega_j^2}{2}-h\\omega_j\\right]\n+Z_{j,xx}&=0,\\\\\n\\omega_{j,t}+\\partial_x[(u_j+2a)\\omega_j-hu_j]-\\omega_{j,xx}&=0.\n\\end{aligned}\\tag{13}\n$$",
