      "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\delta_-f_j&=\\frac{f_j-f_{j-1}}h,&\nM_-f_j&=\\frac{f_j+f_{j-1}}2,\\\\\n\\delta_0f_j&=\\frac{f_{j+1}-f_{j-1}}{2h},&\n\\Delta_hf_j&=\\frac{f_{j+1}-2f_j+f_{j-1}}{h^2}.\n\\end{aligned}\\tag{14}\n$$",
