      "text": "$$\n\\boxed{\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R^{FD}_{1,h}\n&=\\delta_-(u_t+A_x)+M_-v_{xx}=0,\\\\\n\\mathcal R^{FD}_{2,h}\n&=v_t+\\partial_x[bv-4u]+\\partial_x^2\\delta_0u=0.\n\\end{aligned}}\\tag{25}\n$$",
