    {
      "text": "$$\n(Df)_i=\\frac{f_{i-2}-8f_{i-1}+8f_{i+1}-f_{i+2}}{12k},\n\\qquad k=\\Delta x,\\qquad D_2=D^2.\\tag{26}\n$$",
