      "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nP_t^{SD}&=-\\delta_-DH-D^2\\left(M_-v-\\frac{h^2}{4}\\Delta_hP\\right),\\\\\n(W_h)_t^{SD}&=-D[bW_h-4u]+D^2W_h,\\\\\nP_t^{FD}&=-\\delta_-DA-D^2M_-v,\\\\\nv_t^{FD}&=-D[bv-4u]-D^2\\delta_0u.\n\\end{aligned}\\tag{27}\n$$",
