      "text": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal R^{FD}_{1,h}\n={}&(u_t+A_x)_y+v_{xx}\\\\\n&+h^2\\left[\\frac1{24}(u_t+A_x)_{yyy}\n+\\frac18v_{xxyy}\\right]+O(h^4).\n\\end{aligned}\\tag{32}\n$$",
