    {
      "text": "$g(s)=v_{xx}(x,y_c+s,t)$",
      "display": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$$\n\\mathcal R^{FD}_{1,h}\n=\\frac{g(h/2)+g(-h/2)}2-\\frac1h\\int_{-h/2}^{h/2}g(s)\\,ds\n=\\int_{-h/2}^{h/2}K_h(s)g''(s)\\,ds,\\tag{42}\n$$",
