    {
      "text": "$$\n\\left|\\mathcal R^{FD}_{1,h}-\\frac{h^2}{12}v_{xxyy}(x,y_c,t)\\right|\n\\le\\frac{h^4}{480}\\sup_{|s|\\le h/2}|v_{xxyyyy}(x,y_c+s,t)|.\\tag{44}\n$$",
      "display": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$$\n\\left|\\mathcal R^{FD}_{2,h}-\\frac{h^2}{6}u_{xxyyy}(x,y_j,t)\\right|\n\\le\\frac{h^4}{120}\\sup_{|s|\\le h}|u_{xxyyyyy}(x,y_j+s,t)|.\\tag{45}\n$$",
      "display": true
