    {
      "text": "$$\n\\ell=\\frac1{P_s}+\\frac1{Q_s}=\\frac K{P_sQ_s},\\qquad\n\\Omega=q^2-p^2,\\qquad\nz=Kx+\\ell y+\\Omega t+\\varphi.\\tag{47}\n$$",
